nFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_Sh7XLZ5AM0mJBuFNpqz6Lg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_bdi9qqUvE0uovcjEarELcQ">22.5</ix:nonFraction></i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;"> million due under the Company&#8217;s 2026 Term Loan Agreement and 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement, respectively, due within one year at both June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, respectively.</i></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:6.75pt;font-style:italic;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(2)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">Amounts reflect unamortized debt discount and issuance costs of approximately </i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_ONPjm5I_SUGyFl7w28fQKg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:UnamortizedDebtIssuanceExpense" scale="6" id="Narr_EkIpCOYIYEqL8YwJFOtmoQ">4.3</ix:nonFraction></i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;"> million and&#160;</i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_Sh7XLZ5AM0mJBuFNpqz6Lg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:UnamortizedDebtIssuanceExpense" scale="6" id="Narr_vaIgzo97-U2ORHyV9ih-DQ">4.7</ix:nonFraction></i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;"> million at June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, respectively. For the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company recorded approximately </i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_LeqMErBSKUSMxTIrmvq7eA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr__mSxKAy5y02_uajarbMh6w">0.6</ix:nonFraction></i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;"> million and </i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_bj_J0blbIEmNNmT6YBYABw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:InterestExpenseDebt" scale="6" id="Narr__WlGhbnUK0Gdy5HlJPxd_Q">0.8</ix:nonFraction></i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;"> million, respectively, in interest expense reflecting the amortization/accretion of deferred financing costs and debt discount.</i><i style="font-family:'Times';font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;background:#ffffff;"> </i></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:6pt;"></div></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">13</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:36.7pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">BATTALION OIL CORPORATION</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO THE UNAUDITED CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS (continued)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_Vc6cIfTtcUeJI6el0u8I8w_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_Vc6cIfTtcUeJI6el0u8I8w_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Amended and Restated Credit Agreement</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 26, 2024 (the &#8220;Initial Closing Date&#8221;), Halc&#243;n Holdings, LLC (the &#8220;Borrower&#8221;), a wholly-owned subsidiary of the Company, entered into a Second Amended and Restated Senior Secured Credit Agreement (the &#8220;2024 Term Loan Agreement&#8221;) with Fortress Credit Corp. (&#8220;Fortress&#8221;), as administrative agent, and certain other financial institutions party thereto, as lenders. The 2024 Term Loan Agreement amended and restated in its entirety the Company&#8217;s Amended and Restated Senior Secured Credit Agreement, dated November 24, 2021, with Macquarie Bank Limited, as administrative agent, and certain other financial institutions party thereto, as lenders. Pursuant to the 2024 Term Loan Agreement, the lenders party thereto agreed to provide the Borrower with (i) an initial term loan facility in the aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_12_26_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_Wrzj5SbJF0GeEt_RjP47bA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_ETE74R4YrU6yLnLCm1Zqbg">162.0</ix:nonFraction> million, funded on December 26, 2024 and (ii) an incremental term loan facility in the aggregate principal amount of up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_12_26_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_Wrzj5SbJF0GeEt_RjP47bA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="batl:DebtInstrumentIncrementalLoanToBeBorrowed" scale="6" id="Narr_VqQ7cWd2bkeKk0YP2g2wNA">63.0</ix:nonFraction> million to be made available to the Borrower from January 3, 2025 until the date that was the earliest to occur of (x) the date on which such incremental term facility is fully drawn, (y) the date on which such incremental term facility is terminated and (z) January 11, 2025, subject to the satisfaction of certain conditions. On January 9, 2025, the Borrower entered into a first amendment (the &#8220;First Amendment&#8221;) to its 2024 Term Loan Agreement (as amended, the &#8220;2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement&#8221;). Pursuant to the First Amendment, the Borrower incurred incremental term loans in the aggregate principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_1_9_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_b2jqi1uSj0uK5K_WUUvmdg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_Xw5XL-KhNkaWkZhbnL3tzg">63.0</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Incremental Term Loans&#8221;). </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company deferred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_IzciZbwwC0i5t_r829s02Q" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscountPremiumAndDebtIssuanceCostsNet" scale="6" id="Narr_rHSZc4dinEm5r0cJF2azzQ">4.3</ix:nonFraction> million of original issue discount and financing costs on the unaudited condensed consolidated balance sheet at December 31, 2024 in conjunction with entry into the 2024 Term Loan Agreement and deferred an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_wpAg_pixNk6daaxK7TuvSw" contextRef="As_Of_1_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_pXaucw863UK7_xDBRtiABw" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentUnamortizedDiscountPremiumAndDebtIssuanceCostsNet" scale="6" id="Narr_w9RbtUGxXUaYh5Mxfr3hxw">1.8</ix:nonFraction> million of original issue discount and financing costs on the unaudited condensed consolidated balance sheet in conjunction with the issuance of the Incremental Term Loans in January 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement was scheduled to mature on <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_LjVw7OE94EKG7gNrnW3GTA" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityExpirationDate1" id="Narr_2zCcwyyJ90aXGMH4pP8ANw">December 26, 2028</ix:nonNumeric><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;">.  </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:12pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">Borrowings under the 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement initially bore interest at a rate per annum equal to a forward-looking term rate based on the Secured Overnight Financing Rate (&#8220;<span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_14nic7C6G0-8nPPHqHBebw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">SOFR</span></span>&#8221;) for a tenor of three months (with a credit spread adjustment of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure__HAJHAyJfkuHxmsBxJ_Eww" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_LjVw7OE94EKG7gNrnW3GTA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="batl:DebtInstrumentCreditSpreadAdjustmentOnVariableRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_U_Wdo087FE-iv4YLnp9SJw">0.15</ix:nonFraction>% per annum) (or another applicable reference rate, as determined pursuant to the terms of the 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement) plus an applicable margin of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure__HAJHAyJfkuHxmsBxJ_Eww" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_LjVw7OE94EKG7gNrnW3GTA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-2" id="Narr_1DaRb8v8-0yr6tzMG6BJqA">7.75</ix:nonFraction>%. The weighted average interest rate on the Company&#8217;s borrowings under the 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure__HAJHAyJfkuHxmsBxJ_Eww" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_batl_TermLoanCreditAgreement2024Member_LjVw7OE94EKG7gNrnW3GTA" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtWeightedAverageInterestRateOverTime" scale="-2" id="Narr_UdC23b8py0akhHtcn0pWBQ">11.57</ix:nonFraction>%.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">14</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:79.3%;border:0;margin:30pt 10.35% 30pt 10.35%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:10.35%;padding-right:10.35%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:36.7pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">BATTALION OIL CORPORATION</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO THE UNAUDITED CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS (continued)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_QIoYM9H_vUCS3ied-q5h-A_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_5BGAaSQMjkOUjEuefzR4Lw_1_1"></a><a id="Tc_XRyEZXtKCkyIc3b5NYzrGg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_PD3IwHc-f0Si9569IAEXtA_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_HlTlesGqsEushyo2BhSbDQ_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_BNPEQP6pIUS5_9b_ukTH7Q_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_5Pki8g2fF0GfrVoSQO2aEA_5_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_Vc6cIfTtcUeJI6el0u8I8w_cont2" continuedAt="Tb_Vc6cIfTtcUeJI6el0u8I8w_cont3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;">On November 12, 2025, the Company entered into the Second Amendment to the Second Amended and Restated Senior Secured Credit Agreement (the &#8220;Second Amendment&#8221;), effective November 12, 2025, which amended the Applicable Margin (as defined in the 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement) to be the rate per annum set forth below under the caption &#8220;SOFR Loans Spread&#8221; or &#8220;ABR Loans Spread&#8221;, as the case may be, based on the Total Net Leverage Ratio; provided that (a) until the Adjustment Date (the date of delivery of financial statements pursuant to the 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement) following the Second Amendment effective date, the Applicable Margin shall be the applicable rate per annum set forth below in Category 1 and (b) the Applicable Margin shall be the applicable rate per annum set forth in Category 4 below at any time that an Event of Default (as defined in the 2024 Amended Term Loan Agreement) exists:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_LeqMErBSKUSMxTIrmvq7eA" name="batl:ScheduleOfApplicableMarginBasedOnTotalNetLeverageRatioTableTextBlock" id="Tb_QK36voT5bUOJrWVBCLwqSA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><div style="padding-left:45pt;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:82.51%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:47.45%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:26.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:26.19%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width